Code useClipboard: on failure, `toast.error('剪贴板不可用，请在结果框中手动选择并复制')` — toast only, no "重试授权", no auto-select of text. Note useClipboard's fallback uses execCommand; if that fails it toasts. There's no auto-select. Design says "文本已为你全选" — not implemented. Also design says "重试授权" (retry permission). Not implemented.

